=TITLE Download

=head2 The MCP server and search index, offline

Every data release carries C<raku-kb-mcp-offline.tar.gz>. It holds the MCP
server and a prebuilt search index, so an AI agent can use them with no site
build and no network.

=item L<Releases|https://github.com/zag/raku-knowledge-base/releases> — take the newest tag starting with C<data->.
=item L<How to connect it|file:../mcp/index.podlite> — three commands, what the server can do, and what it will not answer.

=begin nested :notice<note>
Downloads of the site itself are still to come.
=end nested


